      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, so the omeprazole will actually help protect my stomach if i take the advil? i feel like it's meant to stop the acid, so wouldn't that make it safe to take the ibuprofen even if my stomach is acting up? i'm thinking of just taking 600mg of advil every 6 hours to get the tooth pain under control.",
